  "description": "<p><span xss=removed>This very elegant </span><span xss=removed>Rotorcraft Classico RC2403 Chrono watch</span><span xss=removed> is made of the very best materials. The brushed case with sleek design details, is made of steel in bronze color. With a matted bronzetone bracelet made of stainless steel, this watch is very elegant to look at. The Classico RC2403 not only has a date indication, it also has a Chrono function shown in the subdials. These subdials also have complementing bronzetone, the striking black dial provides a beautiful contrast. The movement is powered by a LD57 Quartz Caliber. This movement provides a date- and chronograph function. The chrono movement tells 1/10th of second, secondes and up to 60 minutes for accurate (lap)time keeping. Interesting design details on this Classico Rotorcraft watch are the sleek, partialluy open hands and sleek indexes. The crystal used in this striking model is mineral crystal. This Rotorcraft Classico chrono watch has a water resistance of 5 ATM or 50 meters, so suitable for washing hands and swimming if no big temperature variations occur. Not suitable for snorkling.</span></p>",
